{"text": "They led me into a vast building of gray stone, whose doorway was richly carved but badly broken and worn by time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Inside was a great hall full of tables made of polished stone, on which lay heaps of fruit that I had never seen before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The little people sat down on cushions and ate with their hands, throwing the peel and stalks into round openings in the tables. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Following their example, I ate too, for I was very hungry and thirsty after my long journey through time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later I learned that these people ate nothing but fruit, as the horses, cattle, and dogs of our age had all disappeared. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I tried to learn their language by holding up a piece of fruit and asking its name, which made them laugh with delight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But they were like small children who soon grow tired of a game, and after a few minutes they would wander away from me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Seldom had I seen such gentle people, but I soon noticed something strange about them, a complete lack of interest in anything new.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "l", "e", "d", " ", "m", "e", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "v", "a", "s", "t", " ", "b", "u", "i", "l", "d", "i", "n", "g", " ", "o", "f", " ", "g", "r", "a", "y", " ", "s", "t", "o", "n", "e", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", "s", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", "w", "a", "y", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "r", "i", "c", "h", "l", "y", " ", "c", "a", "r", "v", "e", "d", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "b", "a", "d", "l", "y", " ", "b", "r", "o", "k", "e", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "o", "r", "n", " ", "b", "y", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", "s", "i", "d", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "g", "r", "e", "a", "t", " ", "h", "a", "l", "l", " ", "f", "u", "l", "l",